            "content": "<p><strong>Exceptional craftsmanship. More considered pricing.</strong></p><p>At Milano, we design and manufacture our jewelry in-house, giving us greater control over craftsmanship, quality, and cost. By eliminating unnecessary wholesale intermediaries, we can offer fine jewelry at a more considered price without compromising on the quality of the jewelry itself.<br/><br/><strong>Crafted in Our Own Factory</strong><br/>From design and sourcing to casting, hand-setting, polishing, and final inspection, each piece moves through a carefully controlled process before it reaches you.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/our-factory\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/pages/our-factory\">Explore Our Factory →</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/blogs/news/online-jewelry-retailers-compared-who-actually-saves-you-money\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/blogs/news/online-jewelry-retailers-compared-who-actually-saves-you-money\">Explore Our Pricing →</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/blogs/news/milano-vs-traditional-retail\" title=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/blogs/news/milano-vs-traditional-retail\">Milano vs. Traditional Retail →</a><br/></p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
