        "custom_liquid_RDDxhx": {
          "type": "custom-liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% if product.metafields.custom.complete_the_look != blank %}\n\n<style>\n.complete-look-wrapper {\n  margin-top: 32px;\n  padding-top: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Title */\n.complete-look-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n/* Layout */\n.complete-look-scroll {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n/* Each product */\n.complete-look-card {\n  flex: 1;\n  max-width: 48%;\n}\n\n/* Image */\n.complete-look-img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 140px;\n  object-fit: contain;\n}\n\n/* Text */\n.complete-look-name {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.complete-look-price {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  margin: 4px 0 6px;\n}\n\n/* Button */\n.complete-look-btn {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid black;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 0;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n</style>\n\n\n<div class=\"complete-look-wrapper\">\n\n  <div class=\"complete-look-title\">Complete the Look</div>\n\n  <div class=\"complete-look-scroll\">\n    {% for item in product.metafields.custom.complete_the_look.value limit: 2 %}\n      \n      <div class=\"complete-look-card\">\n\n        <a href=\"{{ item.url }}\">\n          <img \n            src=\"{{ item.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }}\" \n            class=\"complete-look-img\"\n            alt=\"{{ item.title }}\"\n          >\n        </a>\n\n        <div class=\"complete-look-name\">{{ item.title }}</div>\n        <div class=\"complete-look-price\">{{ item.price | money }}</div>\n\n        <form method=\"post\" action=\"/cart/add\">\n          <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"id\" value=\"{{ item.variants.first.id }}\">\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"complete-look-btn\">\n            Add to Bag\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n      </div>\n\n    {% endfor %}\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n{% endif %}",
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_zEhq7V": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Insured Free Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p>Milano is committed to delivering a jewelry journey that fills your heart with delight, both today and always. We provide complimentary insured shipping, granting you tranquility with tracking and a signature upon receipt. Our insurance safeguards against loss, damage, or theft while in transit. Should any of these rare incidents occur, we strive diligently to retrieve the item(s). If retrieval isn't possible, we promise a replacement of equivalent quality. Returns within 30 days are straightforward and at no cost within the US, guaranteeing an effortless and pleasant experience for our cherished clientele.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
        "accordion_zh4Jfg": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Lifetime Warranty & Appraisal",
            "icon": "",
            "content": "<p><strong>Lifetime Warranty</strong></p><p>Milano is dedicated to crafting top-tier jewelry designed to stand the test of time. Our aim is to ensure your enduring satisfaction with our pieces. We provide complimentary lifetime cleaning and accept full accountability for any issues stemming from manufacturing flaws. It's important to understand that the warranty does not cover diamonds over 0.10ct, nor does it include center stone diamonds/gemstones on engagement rings. Additionally, damages, losses, and theft are excluded from coverage. Repair charges are determined by our expert jewelers based on service requirements. To maintain warranty eligibility, we advise having all services performed by Milano.</p><p><strong>Appraisal</strong></p><p>Each item with a MSRP value over $1,000 will receive an appraisal document stating the approximate monetary value of your item. This appraisal is solely for insurance purposes only.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "show_in_quickbuy": false
          }
        },
